6. This order will remain operative subject to compliance of the following conditions by the applicant:-
1. The applicant will comply with all the terms and conditions of the bond executed by him;
2. The applicant will cooperate in the investigation/ trial, as the case may be;

5. The applicant will not leave India without previous permission of the trial Court/Investigating Officer, as the case may be;
6. The applicant shall not move in the vicinity of complainant party in any manner and in case of bail jump, his benefit of bail shall immediately be withdrawn.
7.

